  },
  {
    "speaker": "めぐるの友達",
    "text": "ナイスシュート、めぐるー！",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001010020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ、みんなのアシストのおかげだよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300002/1003001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あの子が……八宮めぐるさんか）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……動きにすごくキレがあるな\r\nそれに、なんて楽しそうにプレーをするんだろう）",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001010030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "！！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_a",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300002/1003001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あれ、今目が合ったか……？\r\n友達と何か話してるけど……）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（もしかして、不審者だと思われた……！？）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001010040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……ねえねえ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0118",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300002/1003001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、怪しいものじゃないよ……\r\n俺は君の……",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001010050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "もしかして、プロデューサー！？",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300002/1003001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？\r\nえっと、そうだけど……",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001010060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ、やっぱり合ってた！\r\nそうじゃないかなって思ったんだ～",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300002/1003001010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001010070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "きっとこの人がプロデューサーなんだって、\r\nさっき見た時にビビッと来たんだよ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300002/1003001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001010080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "今日までずっと、お話できるのを\r\n楽しみにしてたの！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300002/1003001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "八宮めぐるさん……でいいのかな",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001010090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！　……あ、でもめぐるさんだと\r\n恥ずかしいから、めぐるでいいよ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300002/1003001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001010100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "これからよろしくね、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300002/1003001010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……こちらこそよろしく",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（積極的な子だな。俺が押されてるようじゃダメだ\r\nこの子のプロデューサーなんだから、しっかりしないと）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "バスケ、すごい上手かったけど、\r\nめぐるはバスケ部なのか？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001010110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ううん。そういうわけじゃないよ\r\n今日は友達の練習にちょっと付き合ってただけなんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300002/1003001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "悪い、邪魔しちゃったか",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001010120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ううん！　友達には、もともと仕事の時間までねって\r\n伝えてたから、大丈夫！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300002/1003001010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、ならいいんだけど……\r\nめぐるはよく友達の練習に付き合ってるのか？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001010130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんっ。バスケ部にバレー部に、水泳部と陸上部でしょ？\r\n他にもスポーツなら、頼まれたらなんでも手伝ってるよ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300002/1003001010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そんなに……\r\n助っ人に引っ張りだこなんだな",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（この子は、身体能力と天性の人懐っこさを\r\n兼ね揃えた、すごいアイドルの卵なのかもしれない……）",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "って、おわっ！\r\n急に引っ張らないでくれ、めぐる……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0108"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001010140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ごめんっ、びっくりさせちゃった？\r\nでも、どうしても早く事務所に行きたくって！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300002/1003001010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001010150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だって楽しいことが待ってるんでしょっ？\r\nほらほら、プロデューサー、早く行こ！",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
